//   ✓ Session Engine
//   ✓ HTF Engine
//   ✓ Trend Engine
//   ✓ Context Engine
//   ✓ Dashboard Framework
//   ✓ Debug Framework
//   ✓ Visual Toggles
//   ✓ Liquidity Engine (NEW)
//       ✓ Swing High / Swing Low detection (no repaint)
//       ✓ Buyside Liquidity (BSL) — SH, EQH
//       ✓ Sellside Liquidity (SSL) — SL, EQL
//       ✓ Equal High / Equal Low classification
//       ✓ Sweep confirmed on previous bar close
//       ✓ Swept level expiry
//       ✓ EVT_BSL_SWEPT / EVT_SSL_SWEPT event vars
//   ✗ FVG Engine             (v2.2.0)
//   ✗ Market Structure       (v2.3.0)
//   ✗ Confluence Scoring     (v2.4.0)
//   ✗ Trade Engine           (v2.5.0)
